
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Happiest Birthday Mrs. Bauni 💗</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{
 margin:0;min-height:100vh;text-align:center;
 font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#783b55;
 background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff0f5,#ffdce9,#fff7fa);
 overflow-x:hidden
}
main{
 position:relative;z-index:1;width:90%;max-width:480px;
 margin:28px auto;padding:26px 20px;
 background:#ffffffe0;border:1px solid #ffd1e0;
 border-radius:25px;box-shadow:0 10px 35px #d98da633
}
h1{color:#d44e82;font-size:2.2rem}
h2{color:#b94d78}
p{line-height:1.7}
button{
 border:0;border-radius:30px;padding:13px 20px;
 margin:8px 3px;background:#e875a0;color:white;
 font-size:16px;cursor:pointer
}
.cake{font-size:75px;margin:16px 0}
#gift,#letter{display:none}
#gift{
 padding:15px;background:#fff0f6;border-radius:15px;line-height:1.8
}
#letter{
 text-align:left;background:#fff0f6;border:1px solid #ffd0e0;
 border-radius:18px;padding:18px;margin-top:18px;
 line-height:1.85;white-space:pre-line;overflow-wrap:anywhere
}
.player{
 width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;border:0;border-radius:15px
}
.heart{
 position:fixed;bottom:-35px;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;
 animation:floatUp 7s linear forwards
}
@keyframes floatUp{
 from{transform:translateY(0);opacity:1}
 to{transform:translateY(-110vh) rotate(35deg);opacity:0}
}
.divider{border:0;border-top:1px solid #ffd1e0;margin:25px 0}
footer{margin-top:24px;font-size:13px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
 <div style="font-size:35px">🎀 💗 🎀</div>
 <h1>Happiest Birthday!</h1>
 <h2>Mrs. Bauni 🥹💕</h2>
 <p>A little birthday surprise made just for you! 💌</p>

 <div class="cake" id="cake">🎂</div>
 <button onclick="openGift()">🎁 Open Your Gift</button>
 <div id="gift">
  🎉 SURPRISEEE! 🎉<br><br>
  You are loved more than you know, Bauni! 💗
  May your life always be full of happiness,
  laughter and beautiful memories. 🧿✨
 </div>

 <hr class="divider">
 <h2>💌 A Letter For You</h2>
 <p>There's something special I want you to read. 🫶🏻</p>
 <button onclick="toggleLetter()">Open Your Letter 💗</button>

 <div id="letter">Happiest Birthday Mrs. Bauni 🎀💗

To my cutest, craziest, and most annoying sister! 😭😂💕

You’re not just my sister, you’re also my built-in bestie, my partner in madness, and the person I can tease endlessly without getting bored. 🤏🏻😂 No matter how much we fight or annoy each other, you’ll always be one of the most precious people in my life. 🫂❤️

I may not say it every day, but I’m genuinely lucky to have a sister like you. I hope life gives you endless reasons to smile, the courage to chase every dream, and all the happiness your beautiful heart deserves. ✨🧿

Keep being the dramatic, goofy, lovable Bauni you are. And please, for once, try not to annoy me so much… okay, never mind, I know that's impossible! 😭🤣💗

Love you forever, meri pagal sister! May your birthday be as beautiful and special as you are. 🎂🎁💝

Happiest Birthday once again, Mrs. Bauni! 🥹💗🫶🏻</div>

 <hr class="divider">
 <h2>💙 Your Birthday Song</h2>
 <p>🎶 blue — yung kai 🎶</p>
 <iframe
  class="player"
  src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/IpFX2vq8HKw"
  title="yung kai - blue official music video"
  allow="encrypted-media; picture-in-picture"
  referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
  allowfullscreen>
 </iframe>
 <p style="font-size:13px">Tap play to listen 💙🎧</p>

 <footer>
  Made with endless love for my favourite sister 💗<br>
  ✨ Always your annoying sibling ✨
 </footer>
</main>

<script>
function openGift(){
 document.getElementById("gift").style.display="block";
 document.getElementById("cake").textContent="🎂🎉💗";
 for(let i=0;i<20;i++)setTimeout(createHeart,i*100);
}
function toggleLetter(){
 const letter=document.getElementById("letter");
 letter.style.display=letter.style.display==="block"?"none":"block";
 if(letter.style.display==="block"){
  letter.scrollIntoView({behavior:"smooth",block:"nearest"});
 }
}
function createHeart(){
 const heart=document.createElement("div");
 heart.className="heart";
 heart.textContent=["💗","💕","💖","💝","🌸","🎀"][Math.floor(Math.random()*6)];
 heart.style.left=Math.random()*100+"vw";
 heart.style.fontSize=(18+Math.random()*18)+"px";
 heart.style.animationDuration=(4+Math.random()*4)+"s";
 document.body.appendChild(heart);
 setTimeout(()=>heart.remove(),8000);
}
setInterval(createHeart,1000);
</script>
</body>
</html>
